% You are an expert Python engineer. Your goal is to write `pdd/server/routes/observability.py`.

% Role & Scope
  Provide project-scoped, read-only FastAPI endpoints for the PDD Connect
  observability dashboard. Reports are local `.pdd` JSON artifacts, not a
  cloud telemetry service.

<include>context/python_preamble.prompt</include>

% Requirements
  1. Export `create_observability_router(project_root: Path) -> APIRouter`.
  2. Expose `/api/v1/observability/runs`, `/runs/{filename}`, and `/modules`.
  3. Gracefully ignore corrupt report files and return empty lists when PDD
     report directories do not exist.
  4. Restrict run-detail lookup to a JSON basename to prevent path traversal.
  5. Never return environment values. Exclude secret-bearing error fields.
  6. Return compact summaries for run lists and safe details only on demand.

% Deliverables
  - Code: `pdd/server/routes/observability.py`
  - Exports: create_observability_router
